  "releaseNotes": "Improves byte sequence handling for TOON encode and decode workflows.\n- Adds ByteArrayFormat encode options so byte sequences can be written as Base64 strings or numeric arrays\n- Improves default byte sequence encoding by using Base64 output for byte[], List<byte>, and IEnumerable<byte>\n- Fixes typed decode so byte[], List<byte>, and IEnumerable<byte> accept Base64 strings and numeric arrays automatically\n- Improves byte sequence performance with span-based and pooled buffering paths plus dedicated benchmark coverage",
